{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/839876-devotion-2ed-written-in-the-rock","id":839876,"title":"[Devotion 2ed.] Written in the Rock","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-01T07:17:32-08:00","id":839876,"title":"[Devotion 2ed.] Written in the Rock","content":"Hi,<br /> <br /> What do you think about this devotion?<br /> <br /> <b><i><u>Written in the Rock</u></i></b><br /> (Dominate 3, Vigor 1)<br /> The kindred can impress his will in his writings, no matter what the support is. It can be a wall painted with blood or lipstick, a book written with ink (even printed) or, as in the name, a sentence carved in the rock. The support must be stained with the blood of the vampire (A little drop of blood at the end of the book or the page or even in the back is enough). The command can be hidden in the middle of a book and just when the right sentences are read the command is impressed in the reader mind.<br /> <b>Cost: </b>1Vitae + 1 willpower<br /> <b>Dice Pool: </b>Intelligence + Expression + Dominate vs. Resolve + Blood Potency<br /> <b>Action: </b>Contested; Resistance is reflexive<br /> The victims read the book that contains the mystical sentences and, if lose the contested roll, fall prey to the command of the kindred. He could kills someone specified in the sentence during the reading of a text in a library or a theatrical representation; he could read the sentences written in a public bathroom and launch a bomb alert. The power of the sentences last for a year for every dot of blood potency but the kindred can, reflexively, spend a willpower to renew the power even if he isn\u2019t near the book.<br /> <br /> This Devotion costs 2 Experience points<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T09:57:53-08:00","id":839987,"title":"","content":"I like this. (I should since I had a character make something very similar once.). Does it affect everyone who reads and understands it (within the context of the duration), only the next person, or does the preparation entail identifying who is to be targeted?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T10:06:49-08:00","id":839995,"title":"","content":"In my intention it should affect everyone who reads. Something like a &quot;DARK TOME&quot; hidden in a library or a crypt, object of legends. But I'm not sure if as it is, it's ok and balanced. I'm not sure about the duration time and vitae cost. But I would like to make a power that lasts through time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T17:21:01-08:00","id":840275,"title":"","content":"I'd probably install some kind of limitations as to the type of commands that can be inserted for a single vitae and willpower. I'd also use Resilience instead of Vigor for purposes of making the devotion's effectiveness last longer than the normal dominate effects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T18:45:26-08:00","id":840306,"title":"","content":"Nice tips. Thank you. I'll add resilence for sure <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T18:48:58-08:00","id":840310,"title":"","content":"Give the option of spending a Willpower dot and the writing, and its affect, will last until someone physically destroys it. That way you could have manuscripts that have lain hidden for centuries, waiting like a serpent to strike.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T19:55:50-08:00","id":840343,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>2ptTakrill</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/839876-devotion-2ed-written-in-the-rock?p=840310#post840310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Give the option of spending a Willpower dot and the writing, and its affect, will last until someone physically destroys it. That way you could have manuscripts that have lain hidden for centuries, waiting like a serpent to strike.</div> </div> </div> </div>I second that. Though if you want the regular effect to be more potent, might I suggest one <i>decade</i> per dot of the vampire's Blood Potency instead of one year per dot?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-02T02:54:06-08:00","id":840509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deionscribe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/839876-devotion-2ed-written-in-the-rock?p=840343#post840343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I second that. Though if you want the regular effect to be more potent, might I suggest one <i>decade</i> per dot of the vampire's Blood Potency instead of one year per dot?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> really? I'd make the writing last until it's read once, unless a dot of WP was spent. <br /> As is, this is the most easy way to make cheap commands. Write down what you want the person to do, (&quot;like follow my every command until sunrise&quot;) and then you only use Dominate 1 to force people to read it. <br /> <br /> That way, you save up tons of resources...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-02T03:14:39-08:00","id":840524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Griautis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/839876-devotion-2ed-written-in-the-rock?p=840509#post840509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> really? I'd make the writing last until it's read once, unless a dot of WP was spent.<br /> As is, this is the most easy way to make cheap commands. Write down what you want the person to do, (&quot;like follow my every command until sunrise&quot;) and then you only use Dominate 1 to force people to read it.<br /> <br /> That way, you save up tons of resources...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I thought about something that could have the effect of a &quot;cursed boock&quot; for example. After its reading, people go crazy and kill everyone in a room, for example. But something that lasts in time not just for a single achievement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-02T05:18:18-08:00","id":840570,"title":"","content":"Well then it needs a bigger cost than a point of vitae and a point of willpower... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-02T06:10:38-08:00","id":840591,"title":"","content":"how much do you think would be ok? Could maybe the large amount of vitae be jutified mixing the blood directly with the ink? Just to not to dirty all the book/page with blood <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-02T07:14:27-08:00","id":840627,"title":"","content":"Vitae spent does not all have to leave your body. This is not blood sorcery, this is a devotion for a Discipline. For all I care, even if this costs 100 vitae (which obviously it shouldn't), the vampire would only need to actually bleed just enough as he wants to mark the pages/write/whatever. The rest can go away in the usual activate discipline manner. <br /> <br /> As for the actual cost.. I'm thinking maybe some 3-5 vitae, +1vitae each time interval if you want to keep the effect for longer periods of time, OR 3-5 vitae and a dot of willpower to make it permanent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-02T07:46:02-08:00","id":840649,"title":"","content":"Balance Suggestion: Add up the costs of all the normal dominate powers that will be used, per individual target, and that's the additional cost in Vitae (Plus the Devotion activation.) Once the total number of targets are reached, the effect ends. <br /> <br /> If you are just doing the basic no-cost Mesmerism, for example, no extra blood is needed beyond the activation cost. If you are doing the longer / deeper dominates, it costs extra blood as normal. I'd do this in part to specifically to get around the loophole of making a business card with a Dominate power that costs multiple vitae, then using the mesmerize &quot;Read my card&quot; over and over to avoid that cost forever. <br /> <br /> Alternatively (or additionally) you could put a limit on the effects based upon the medium. So fleeting things like snow-writing or writing in the shower steam on someone's window can store very little vitae. Scroll or book pages can hold more. Engravings and carvings can hold more. Sculpture and Architecture the most. The default becomes books / scrolls, since the medium is the most common to have multiple pages.<br /> <br /> Also, because there's always someone:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.bridetobe.com.au/images/default-source/article-library/sky-writing-marry-me-marriage-proposal.jpg?sfvrsn=0\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4047-holy","name":"Holy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}